<p>Play in {{STATE_NAME}}: {{INTRO}}.</p>
<p>Pick the name set "{{SET_NAME}}" for a new game. Then just build: every new Road Stop and station in a known city gets a real local name a moment after you place it.</p>
<h4>Features</h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>{{STATE_NAME}} towns</strong>: a name set with {{TOWN_COUNT}} real towns and places, from big cities to {{TOWN_FLAVOUR}} (US Census Bureau data).</li>{{CLIMATE_LI}}{{STREET_LI}}
<li><strong>{{STATE_NAME}}-style streets everywhere else</strong>: other towns draw their stop names from {{GENERIC_STREET_COUNT}} street names in the local style{{STREET_FLAVOUR}}.</li>{{STATION_LI}}{{NEIGHBORHOOD_LI}}
<li><strong>Everything else follows</strong>: industries, depots and their stations are named after your {{STATE_NAME}} towns by the game itself.</li>
</ul>
<h4>Settings</h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>Real street names</strong> (default On): renames new Road Stops in known cities after their real streets.</li>
<li><strong>Real station names</strong> (default On): renames new train stations, bus and tram stations, airports and harbours in known cities.</li>
</ul>
<h4>Notes</h4>
<ul>
<li>Unlike a plain name set, this mod also renames the stops and stations you build after real streets, stations and neighbourhoods in their city.</li>
<li>Street and station names also work with any other name set, in towns that carry {{A_STATE_NAME}} city's name (rename a town to {{BIGGEST_TOWN}} and its next stop is on a real {{BIGGEST_TOWN}} street).</li>
<li>Only renames what you build, right after you build it. Existing stops and stations are never touched, and neither are your own renames.</li>
<li>Cosmetic only, safe to add to an existing save. A game started with the "{{SET_NAME}}" name set needs this mod to load; in any other save, removing it keeps the names already given and stops renaming.</li>{{EXTRA_NOTES}}
</ul>
<h4>Credits</h4>
<ul>
<li>Towns and populations: US Census Bureau (public domain). Street, station and neighbourhood lists: our own selection of well-known real names.</li>
<li>State flag on the cover: {{FLAG_CREDIT}}.</li>
</ul>
